        <div class="bio-body">
          <p>Dual-qualified in New York and Texas, with 18+ years of experience across federal litigation, corporate compliance, cross-border advisory, and complex legal structuring.</p>
          <p>Before founding UOA Legal, he served as Anti-Bribery &amp; Corruption Lead at Shell SPDC — operating under a U.S. Department of Justice Deferred Prosecution Agreement, one of the most demanding regulatory environments in global energy. That experience produced something most attorneys don't have: a litigation-informed, risk-calibrated instinct that surfaces problems before they become crises.</p>
          <p>He has appeared before federal courts including the U.S. Court of International Trade, prosecuted Article 78 proceedings against New York State agencies, and built elite legal strategies for global founders, executives, and investors.</p>
